{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》陪伴觀眾多年，劇中不少家庭的感情早已由戲內延伸到戲外！日前，飾演「譚育英 (Bonnie)」的林凱恩在社交平台激罕晒出與劇中爸爸「譚道德」陳榮峻及媽媽吳香倫的溫馨合照，瞬間喚起大批劇迷的集體回憶！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b259e746-5afc-4198-a30d-9f04462aa3c0.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026WE77HCfLyu1786950459.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b259e746-5afc-4198-a30d-9f04462aa3c0.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">原來，這段情背後藏著一個超完美的巧合，三人竟然同屬8月份的壽星！相中可見，他們齊齊圍著一個寫有「譚氏一家幸福快樂」的精緻草莓蛋糕，三人更齊心閉眼雙手合十許願，畫面溫馨滿瀉，足證「譚氏一家」私下感情深厚。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"71a35046-99f4-4a3d-aeef-a4db3fbdeee3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026dC22QogBoA1786950459.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"71a35046-99f4-4a3d-aeef-a4db3fbdeee3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">面對這份難得的緣份，她亦忍不住感性發文：「故事內容或許虛構，但所投入的親情卻真摯無比，感恩緣份，讓我擁有我們這一家。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">林凱恩更暖心向一眾劇迷承諾，在另一個平行時空，「譚氏一家」絕對會繼續陪大家談聖賢與道德！她<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">並附上「爸爸媽媽陪我長大」、「在世間遮風擋雨有一種愛」以及「都是8月壽星」等標籤，獲不少劇迷留言祝福。</span><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5d914c4b-f512-4988-9209-1f8fc8e3385e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026LH5OJEzmnN1786950459.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5d914c4b-f512-4988-9209-1f8fc8e3385e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T08:29:07.256599+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":372,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}